00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:41.240
But before I share with you my workflow,

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.080
I wanna talk about why do
something like this at all.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:46.280
Like why set up a workflow so
that your AI can make videos?

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:49.960
And if you think about it,
simultaneous visual and

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:54.600
audio input is the best way
that we absorb information.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:57.360
Like if you think about how we
learn every topic in school,

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:01.000
we had a teacher explain something
to us while showing something on the

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:05.500
whiteboard or on some slides, and that's
also how we learn from YouTube videos.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.800
Like that's why YouTube videos
are so powerful for learning

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:11.440
things because not only are you
getting information through audio,

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:15.680
you're also seeing that information,
displayed in a different way in real time.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:19.740
So you have more forms of input, and that
helps your brain understand things better.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:23.860
Like for example, if you were studying
for a test, you could create a

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.960
visual explainer that summarizes
all the different topics so that you

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:31.680
could just watch that before a test
and give you the ultimate refresher.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.020
And there's also a lot of topics that's

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.940
just way better if you
have a visual medium.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:39.100
Like for example, anything that has
a bunch of charts or diagrams or

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:44.040
math or even music theory and
biology, these are things that are way

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.900
easier to understand when you have
a visual or auditory element to it.

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:52.040
And there are already a lot of really
amazing explainer videos on YouTube,

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:55.940
but the problem with that is that they
are made for a super broad audience,

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:59.580
so they're less applicable when you're
trying to learn something very specific.

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:02.260
And also the applications
of videos made by

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:07.340
AI also goes beyond
just making explainers.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:12.140
You could use it to make daily briefs,
to make, summaries on different news

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:15.800
or topics that you care about, like
things that are very specific to you.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:19.860
So for example, one workflow I have
is to have my AI assistant create a

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:24.560
daily brief of different news and tweets
in a 60-second video so I can just

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:29.580
